                    <div class="ts-item"><span class="ts-ok">✓</span><span class="ts-cmd">Edit</span> <span class="ts-target">internal/auth/token.go</span> <span class="ts-meta">(+14, -3)</span></div>
                    <div class="ts-item"><span class="ts-ok">✓</span><span class="ts-cmd">Run</span> <span class="ts-target">go test ./internal/auth/...</span> <span class="ts-meta">(PASS in 84ms)</span></div>
                  </div>
