                  <p>I have updated <code>ResolveToken</code> to check <code>cfg.GitHubToken</code>, then inspect <code>GITHUB_TOKEN</code> and <code>GH_TOKEN</code> before falling back to the <code>gh</code> CLI.</p>
                  
                  <div class="snippet-fence">
                    <div class="sf-hdr"><span>go</span><span class="sf-copy">Copy</span></div>
                    <pre><code><span class="k">if</span> tok := os.<span class="fn">Getenv</span>(<span class="s">"GH_TOKEN"</span>); tok != <span class="s">""</span> &#123;
    <span class="k">return</span> tok, nil
&#125;</code></pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="touched-chips">
                    <span class="tc-label">Touched:</span>
                    <span class="t-chip" title="Click to view file in editor">token.go <b class="chip-add">+14</b> <b class="chip-del">−3</b></span>
                    <span class="tc-auto-reload">✓ tab reloaded</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Thread compose box -->
            <div class="tp-compose">
